<body>
    <h1>🔧 Anatomical Proportions & Anti-Spinning Fixes</h1>

    <div class="fix-section fix-1">
        <h2>🎯 Fix #1: Anatomically Correct Foot Placement</h2>

        <h3>📐 The Problem & Solution</h3>
        <table class="comparison-table">
            <tr>
                <th>Aspect</th>
                <th class="before">Before (Broken)</th>
                <th class="after">After (Fixed)</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Front-Back Distance</strong></td>
                <td class="before">Tiny arbitrary: <code>±15 units</code></td>
                <td class="after">Anatomical: <code>±50% of body length</code></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Horse Body Length</strong></td>
                <td class="before">200 units → foot gap: 30 units</td>
                <td class="after">200 units → foot gap: <span class="measurement">100 units</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Lizard Body Length</strong></td>
                <td class="before">180 units → foot gap: 30 units</td>
                <td class="after">180 units → foot gap: <span class="measurement">90 units</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Leg Spacing (L/R)</strong></td>
                <td class="before">Fixed: <code>30 units</code></td>
                <td class="after">Proportional: <code>40% of leg length</code></td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <h3>🧮 Anatomical Calculations</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Shoulder-Hip Distance:</strong> <code>bodyLength × 0.5</code></li>
            <li><strong>Leg Spacing:</strong> <code>legLength × 0.4</code></li>
            <li><strong>Lizard Adjustments:</strong> 30% wider stance, 20% shorter torso for sprawling</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="fix-section fix-2">
        <h2>🌪️ Fix #2: Anti-Spinning During Sharp Turns</h2>

        <h3>🎛️ Damping & Velocity Limits Added</h3>
        <table class="comparison-table">
            <tr>
                <th>Control</th>
                <th class="before">Before (Spinning)</th>
                <th class="after">After (Smooth)</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Angular Velocity</strong></td>
